segment.source:
::"Press the button with a red cross symbol to invoke a call for medical treatment of endangered passengers.

Press the button with a red rathound symbol to invoke a call for situations where natural wildlife is impairing the traversability of the nearby trains.

Press the button with a green shield symbol for situations where human interference is in any way tarnishing the experience of your traveling experience."::&lt;end&gt;

