::"Press the button with a yellow wrench to invoke local mechanized support team to help out with a mechanical problem on either the train or the railroad.

Press the button with a red exclamation mark for situations where a hazardous event has made train traversal potentially threatening to the health of the passengers.

Press the button with a blue question mark for more information."::&lt;end&gt;

